cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DeBRief.jl in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "DeBRief.jl: a Julia client for Brazilian public-security statistics (Sinesp/MJSP)"
abstract: >-
  DeBRief.jl downloads, caches and normalizes the crime and violence
  statistics published by Brazil's Ministry of Justice and Public Security
  (MJSP) through the Sinesp platform: the Sinesp-VDE monthly,
  municipality-level database (2015-present, 28 indicators) and the classic
  state-level series (2015-2022, nine typologies). It provides a single
  stable long-format schema, accent- and case-insensitive filters, disk
  caching, and per-100k rates from IBGE/SIDRA population estimates.
